        "Title": "The Royal Six: The Homewrecker (Target2)",
        "Location": "LOCATION_ANCESTRAL_BULLDOG",
        "PublicId": "128555029296",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Ancestral/scene_bulldog.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 549f935c-aa35-44dc-bc3b-e70928190a2c).Image",
        "Description": "Excellent work in Sapienza, 47. Our client has reached out again with a new target for you.\r\rYour second target is Annabel Jones, aka &quot;The Homewrecker.&quot; Ms Jones is a master of seduction and manipulation. Our client&apos;s intel indicates that she is currently working undercover at the Carlisle estate in Dartmoor, England. Our insiders in the estate indicate that Ms Jones is spending a lot of time with a Mr Taylor, likely to manipulate him.\r\rYour mission is this: kill Jones, Taylor, and the contact.",
        "GameVersion": "8.18.0.0",
        "IsPublished": true,
        "Entitlements": [
            "LOCATION_ANCESTRAL"
        ],
